    "page_text_en": "Long ago, there was a greedy and fierce gray wolf.\n\nThe gray wolf wandered around the forest all day, looking for something delicious to eat.\n\nThat day, he passed by the little rabbit's house.\n\nAt the door, he saw the rabbit's door was open, so he slipped in.\n\nThe rabbit wasn't home, so the gray wolf hid in the rabbit's stove hole, planning to rush out and eat the rabbit as soon as the rabbit came in.\n\nBut, the rabbit saw the gray wolf from afar, sneaking into his own home. The rabbit lay on the windowsill and saw the gray wolf hiding in the stove hole. He didn't enter the house, and waited until the gray wolf was inside the stove hole, hitting...",
    "summary_zh": "本页讲述了从前有一只贪心又凶暴的大灰狼，它在森林里转悠寻找食物，路过小兔家时发现门开着便溜了进去，躲在灶洞里准备吃小兔；而小兔从远处看见大灰狼进屋，趴在窗台上观察，发现大灰狼躲在灶洞里并未进门，正等待着。"
