    "image_path": "images/slide_04.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "这时大灰狼的肚子咕咕直叫，他看见远处树上有只小乌鸦正惊奇地瞧着他呢。\n\n大灰狼又叫唤起来：“我被烤焦了，我被烤焦了，我闻到身上的肉香味儿了……”说完，他假装昏死过去。\n\n那只小乌鸦以为大灰狼真的被烤得焦黑焦黑的了，他想尝尝烤狼肉的味道，便悄悄地靠近大灰狼。\n\n大灰狼眯着眼睛，瞧着小乌鸦一点一点靠近。等小乌鸦到了身边，大灰狼伸出爪子一把揪住了小乌鸦的尾巴。",
    "page_text_en": "At this moment, the big gray wolf's stomach growled. He saw a little crow on a distant tree, looking at him in surprise.\n\nThe big gray wolf called out again: \"I'm being roasted, I'm being roasted, I can smell the meaty aroma on my body...\" Then, he pretended to faint.\n\nThe little crow thought the big gray wolf was really roasted black and charred. He wanted to taste the roasted wolf meat, so he quietly approached the big gray wolf.\n\nThe big gray wolf squinted his eyes, watching the little crow inch closer and closer. When the little crow reached his side, the big gray wolf extended his claws and grabbed the little crow's tail.",
    "summary_zh": "大灰狼假装被烤焦并昏死过去，引诱小乌鸦靠近，趁其不备一把抓住了小乌鸦的尾巴。"
