    "image_path": "images/slide_05.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "小乌鸦拼命挣扎，好不容易挣断了尾巴，扑扑翅膀飞回了大树。大树上的乌鸦姥姥看见自己的宝宝成了一只秃尾巴乌鸦，心急极了。\n这时，没逮住乌鸦的大灰狼生气地在屋顶上走来走去，他不敢往地面上跳。\n乌鸦姥姥朝小兔家门口看了看，发现那里有个小池塘，乌鸦姥姥想了想就唱了起来：\nWu-Wu\n大灰狼，大灰狼，快往池塘里跳——凉快快快，洗个澡，凉快澡。\n大灰狼想：对啊，朝池塘里跳没有什么危险，自己会游泳，正好洗个凉快澡。",
    "page_text_en": "The little crow struggled desperately and finally broke off its tail, flapping its wings back to the big tree. The crow grandmother on the tree saw her baby had become a tailless crow and was extremely worried.\nAt this moment, the big gray wolf, who hadn't caught the crow, angrily walked back and forth on the roof, too afraid to jump down to the ground.\nThe crow grandmother looked toward the little rabbit's front door and noticed a small pond there. She thought for a moment and then sang:\nWu-Wu\nBig gray wolf, big gray wolf, jump into the pond quickly—cool and quick, take a bath, cool bath.\nThe big gray wolf thought: Right, jumping into the pond is not dangerous at all. I can swim, just perfect for a cool bath.",
    "summary_zh": "小乌鸦挣断尾巴飞回大树，乌鸦姥姥心急；大灰狼在屋顶徘徊，乌鸦姥姥唱起歌谣引诱大灰狼跳入池塘洗澡，大灰狼信以为真，准备跳入池塘。"
